# Fallout: New Vegas's opening on Fallout 4, part 1: VCG01, Ain't That a Kick in the Head, to the Vit-o-matic.
# Runs after Fallout 4's character creation, on an MO2 profile with FalloutNV.esm ("New Vegas"):
#   python -m tools.live.fo4_story_cases tests/story/fo4_creation.f4test tests/story/fnv_opening --set SEX=male
# Leaving the sink sets VCG00 stage 0: FNV's intro movie (FNVIntro.bik, skipped with T twice), the cemetery,
# then stage 100 moves the player to Doc Mitchell's and sets VCG01 stage 0.
# Speakers are display names; INFOs and refs are the source (FalloutNV.esm) FormIDs.
# Source refs: the trigger before the Vit-o-matic 104C16, the Vit-o-matic 104C13 (docs/fork/fo4_opening_progression_plan.md).

case vcg01_wake_up
until 120 GetStageDone FNV_VCG00 0 == 1              # leaving the sink starts the source game
menu 60 PlayBinkMenu                                  # VCG00 stage 0's intro movie, interruptible
wait 2
press T
wait 1
press T
until 300 GetStageDone FNV_VCG00 100 == 1             # the cemetery: Benny, Victor; 100 hands off to VCG01
until 120 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 10                    # Doc's timers and lines; 10 names the player (a note on FO4)
until 120 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 20                    # 17's Male/Female box answers itself with the mirror's sex
until 120 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 40                    # 36's Reflectron is the mirror's (skipped): 40 on leaving it
until 120 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 55                    # Doc's lines set 45 and 55: the player may walk
end

case vcg01_vit_o_matic
walk {FalloutNV.esm:104C16}                           # into the trigger before the machine: 60
until 10 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 60
heard Doc Mitchell 001074A2                           # Doc's line at 60 shows objective 30 as it ends; the machine checks it
walk {FalloutNV.esm:104C13} 64                        # to the Vit-o-matic
activate {FalloutNV.esm:104C13}                       # use it: 65, and the SPECIAL card opens
menu 30 SPECIALMenu
invoke SPECIALMenu List_mc.selectedIndex=1            # Strength; each 5, with 5 points to spend (40)
invoke SPECIALMenu IncrementPoints()                  # the right arrow
invoke SPECIALMenu IncrementPoints()
invoke SPECIALMenu IncrementPoints()
invoke SPECIALMenu IncrementPoints()
invoke SPECIALMenu IncrementPoints()
invoke SPECIALMenu BGSCodeObj.startEditText()           # edit the name, as pressing its row does
invoke SPECIALMenu onVirtualKeyboardResult Courier 1          # the card shows the name
invoke SPECIALMenu BGSCodeObj.endEditText Courier            # and the game takes it, as the card does on Enter
close 30 SPECIALMenu                                  # its Done (tryCloseMenu), as the Accept button
closed 30 SPECIALMenu
until 10 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 65
end

case vcg01_psych_test
until 120 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 80                    # Doc reacts (70), the skull test is skipped (76, 79), he heads for his chair (80)
walk {FalloutNV.esm:103E55} 100                       # DocMitchellCouchREF, inside VCG01DocMitchellCouchTriggerREF
activate {FalloutNV.esm:103E55}                       # sit: the trigger sees the player seated, then Doc starts the talk
menu 120 DialogueMenu                                 # 0010558F: "...say the first thing that comes to mind. Dog."
look {FalloutNV.esm:104C0F}                           # DocMitchellREF: seated, the player faces the couch's way
choose 60 Cat.
choose 60 Shelter.
choose 60 Campfire.
choose 60 Bribe.
choose 60 Dark.
choose 60 Caretaker.
choose 60 Strongly agree.                             # five statements
choose 60 Strongly agree.
choose 60 Strongly agree.
choose 60 Strongly agree.
choose 60 Strongly agree.
choose 60 A broken chain.                             # three inkblots
choose 60 I see a priceless work of art.
choose 60 A light in the darkness.
until 60 GetStageDone FNV_VCG01 85 == 1              # "Well, that is all she wrote": its end sets 85
end

case vcg01_tags_traits
until 60 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 90                     # 85 timer: SetTagSkills 3 opens our CRUI_LevelUp in TagsMode
menu 60 CRUI_LevelUp
wait 2                                                # Open fills the menu
invoke CRUI_LevelUp ProcessUserEvent XButton 0        # X (released) keeps the three tags the psych test suggested
closed 30 CRUI_LevelUp
until 120 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 102                   # Doc trait intro (95), its timer (98, 100): ShowTraitMenu (102)
menu 60 CRUI_LevelUp
wait 2
invoke CRUI_LevelUp ProcessUserEvent XButton 0        # no traits: X keeps none
closed 30 CRUI_LevelUp
until 60 GetStage FNV_VCG01 >= 105                    # Doc farewell transition
end
